{"v":4,"catch":"呈現像素圖案的經典動作平台遊戲。","desc":"化身年輕忍者 Yuhiko 參加冒險，他要前往陰間為他的兄弟尋找治療方法。在神秘所在找到鬼魂，他們會說故事給你聽或是給你建議。探索地牢，和怪物戰鬥並認識新朋友！\n\n遊戲的第二部分將以新的敵人類型、新的遊戲機制和與危險首領的戰鬥令你驚喜。若你願意，每個關卡也可以嘗試以速度通關。遊戲的第二部分不僅適合已經熟悉Mangavania黑白世界的人，也適合新加入系列的玩家。\n\n年輕的忍者能拯救他的兄弟嗎？如果可以，代價是什麼？","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2024-08-22","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/06da2c5f9b8af56f475c19e4b641a490759c1f1bc2831908f5f92cc4c67dba48.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8f0aa627849ca8f1c9dac8a4e85a37b2fbedc94d0630e4169f48bebf55df6057.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69f5eeff052939b7a0ea74fe7f2840b757bd224d6d63f712e245fa01be6c3af1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c34aafdc8c61b066405afe7b9badcf73736e8e25e2eb928b8b0c0dd6bb9a920.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5bb51b4ee12cd22de62a54379be9bdb22557836ff1ff3dc4036a0df3d36b822.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/08ab31aacf0abe278c023d0cab7394cfc9b84434eaead4cc64ae91e6277c202b.jpg"],"titleId":"01003ce01ca34000","dlc":[]}